"""
Apollo Mission Control CAPCOM Audio & Intercom Console
Master Output (RX) Volume, Capsule Communicator (TX) Microphone Gain,
Live Real-Time Mic VU Meter (RMS + Peak Hold), Sidetone Loopback Test,
WirePlumber / PipeWire Routing & Sink/Source Selector with Segmented Cairo Meters.
Inspired by Apollo Mission Operations Control Room (MOCR) CAPCOM Audio Consoles.
Zero white backgrounds — pure dark chassis, phosphor glows, and precision mechanical/digital indicators.
"""
